WEBVTT

01:30.300 --> 01:34.960
[The Heir]

01:35.400 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 15]

01:47.200 --> 01:48.070
Zhen.

01:51.870 --> 01:52.789
Zhen.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.229
Why have you come?

01:55.120 --> 01:57.039
I came to bring you something.

01:58.509 --> 02:00.840
This is from Seventh Grandmother for you.

02:06.200 --> 02:08.360
This... This is a box of pastries

02:08.360 --> 02:10.000
that Seventh Grandmother and I
made together.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.280
Please try some, Zhen.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.000
Zhen, I was wrong.

02:47.970 --> 02:49.230
[To Zhen]

03:08.280 --> 03:09.360
"Zhen,

03:09.800 --> 03:12.470
about what happened at the Li household
some days ago,

03:12.470 --> 03:13.960
I know

03:14.310 --> 03:16.590
you suffered a great grievance.

03:17.630 --> 03:20.240
And yet I didn't stand up for you.

03:20.400 --> 03:22.520
That was my fault.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.520
Now the Li family

03:25.630 --> 03:29.850
faces troubles both within and without,
and its members have become divided.

03:29.850 --> 03:32.050
I wanted to keep you,

03:32.400 --> 03:36.910
but despite my wishes,
I was powerless to do so.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.910
Regarding the stolen ink recipe,

03:40.079 --> 03:43.430
I feel I have deeply wronged you.

03:44.870 --> 03:45.750
Zhen,

03:46.079 --> 03:46.870
from now on,

03:47.030 --> 03:48.360
just feel free to do

03:48.360 --> 03:50.280
as your heart desires.

03:51.190 --> 03:55.560
This is a small token from me.

03:56.150 --> 03:58.400
You must accept it."

04:10.660 --> 04:12.470
Together with Mr. Fan's 10 chests of ink,

04:12.470 --> 04:15.520
the dividend from the ancient lacquer-soot ink
comes to 800 taels.

04:15.520 --> 04:16.950
Once the money comes in,

04:16.950 --> 04:18.040
have it sent to my sister.

04:18.040 --> 04:18.600
Yes.

04:20.560 --> 04:21.269
Master.

04:22.310 --> 04:23.950
I hear that Miss Li Zhen

04:24.000 --> 04:26.730
has already rented a storefront
on Sibao Street.

04:29.830 --> 04:32.360
She truly has
great determination and drive.

04:32.470 --> 04:34.070
But rent on Sibao Street

04:34.430 --> 04:35.720
isn't cheap.

04:36.480 --> 04:38.340
She likely has little money left.

04:38.830 --> 04:39.720
Yes.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.390
It speaks to Miss Li Zhen's

04:41.390 --> 04:43.250
all-or-nothing determination!

04:44.040 --> 04:46.560
She's every bit as brave as the soldiers

04:46.680 --> 04:48.000
on the battlefield.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.440
I've noticed something.

04:50.950 --> 04:54.010
You've been bringing up
Miss Li Zhen quite a lot lately.

04:54.510 --> 04:56.310
It's not that I keep bringing her up.

04:56.310 --> 04:58.710
Isn't it because you want to
hear about her?

04:59.630 --> 05:00.190
Hey!

05:01.000 --> 05:02.290
Who said you could drink my tea?

05:02.290 --> 05:03.890
You didn't even pour me a cup.

05:07.160 --> 05:08.360
That was the last sip!

05:10.090 --> 05:11.170
You little rascal.

05:16.630 --> 05:17.870
Sibao Street...

05:21.270 --> 05:22.160
President Hu,

05:23.070 --> 05:25.470
is there something wrong with my document?

05:30.390 --> 05:32.110
Or is it because my New Li's Ink Workshop

05:32.110 --> 05:35.240
doesn't meet
the Literary Association's regulations?

05:36.800 --> 05:38.310
Please say something!

05:39.430 --> 05:40.630
If neither is the case,

05:40.630 --> 05:42.760
why do you keep refusing to approve it?

05:49.240 --> 05:51.830
If it were anyone else,

05:52.510 --> 05:56.070
they would be helping strengthen
the Huizhou ink industry,

05:56.270 --> 05:58.070
and I would gladly approve it.

05:59.480 --> 06:00.630
But Miss Li Zhen,

06:01.040 --> 06:02.360
throughout history,

06:02.830 --> 06:03.960
there has never been

06:04.000 --> 06:07.800
a precedent for two ink workshops
operating under the same surname.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.880
As long as Li Ink still stands,

06:10.120 --> 06:12.120
it's absolutely impossible for you

06:12.750 --> 06:14.490
to establish your own ink business.

06:14.490 --> 06:17.570
President Hu,
although my surname is still Li,

06:17.600 --> 06:19.680
our Eighth Branch was expelled
from the clan long ago.

06:19.680 --> 06:22.000
There's a written expulsion document
to prove it.

06:22.000 --> 06:23.240
By law and by right,

06:23.310 --> 06:25.240
I'm no longer part of the Li family.

06:25.480 --> 06:27.190
Li Ink runs its own business,

06:27.310 --> 06:29.040
and I'll run my New Li's Ink Workshop.

06:29.040 --> 06:31.100
We have nothing to do with each other.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.360
But Li Ink is,

06:32.950 --> 06:35.650
after all, the foremost
of the four major ink-makers

06:35.650 --> 06:37.250
in the Huizhou ink industry.

06:37.630 --> 06:38.800
The association

06:38.870 --> 06:40.800
must consider Li Ink's standing.

06:41.190 --> 06:42.390
Miss Li Zhen,

06:42.800 --> 06:44.870
if you truly wish to open an ink workshop,

06:44.870 --> 06:47.950
you will need Li Ink's approval.

06:48.360 --> 06:50.220
Only then can I, as the president,

06:50.390 --> 06:51.920
make any exception.

07:07.430 --> 07:09.390
Was it you who went to
the Literary Association just now?

07:09.390 --> 07:10.750
You stopped the association

07:10.750 --> 07:13.680
from approving
my New Li's Ink Workshop, didn't you?

07:15.750 --> 07:17.560
If you don't
explain yourself clearly today,

07:17.560 --> 07:19.090
you are not going anywhere!

07:19.120 --> 07:21.120
Li Ink, a century-old establishment

07:21.120 --> 07:22.360
and the orthodox lineage of Hui Ink.

07:22.360 --> 07:25.040
How could we allow a mere brat like you

07:25.040 --> 07:27.680
to go off and start
your own New Li Ink business?

07:28.000 --> 07:30.750
Before, when Seventh Grandmother
wanted to renew the contract with me,

07:30.750 --> 07:32.430
you people immediately started gossiping,

07:32.430 --> 07:33.870
saying that I, an outsider,

07:33.870 --> 07:35.270
wanted to seize your assets and power.

07:35.270 --> 07:35.920
Fine.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.830
I refuse to be counted
as part of your family

07:37.830 --> 07:39.190
and wish to open my own ink workshop—

07:39.190 --> 07:40.560
that should satisfy you, shouldn't it?

07:40.560 --> 07:41.950
But now you say,

07:42.120 --> 07:43.630
with the same family name,

07:43.630 --> 07:46.230
there's no way I can open
a second ink workshop.

07:47.040 --> 07:49.120
You people want it both ways,
saying whatever suits you.

07:49.120 --> 07:51.190
Who exactly is the one
being unreasonable here?

07:51.190 --> 07:53.190
I won't waste my breath

07:53.240 --> 07:54.500
arguing with you here.

07:55.159 --> 07:57.270
Let me make the thing clear today—

07:57.800 --> 07:58.600
Li Zhen,

08:00.600 --> 08:03.040
if you think you can
establish another ink workshop,

08:03.040 --> 08:03.920
dream on.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.830
If you insist on having your own way,

08:06.950 --> 08:09.480
don't blame me for bringing out
the Founder's Black Banner again

08:09.480 --> 08:12.240
and invoking our Founding Master
to pass judgment...

08:12.240 --> 08:14.440
The Founder's Black Banner again, huh?

08:14.560 --> 08:15.430
Listen up,

08:15.920 --> 08:17.000
I've already been expelled from the clan.

08:17.000 --> 08:19.480
I'm not afraid of
your Black Banner whatsoever.

08:19.480 --> 08:20.810
I'll just say one thing—

08:21.240 --> 08:22.630
whether you, Li Jingdong,

08:22.630 --> 08:24.190
or your Li Ink

08:24.190 --> 08:25.680
ever give your approval or not,

08:25.680 --> 08:27.360
I am opening New Li's Ink Workshop

08:27.360 --> 08:28.480
no matter what!

08:33.510 --> 08:37.309
[Songtan Manor]

08:37.390 --> 08:38.370
[Ink Workshop Application]

08:47.960 --> 08:48.750
Miss Li Zhen,

08:49.840 --> 08:52.720
you want me to step in

08:53.510 --> 08:57.440
and have the Literary Association approve
your New Li's Ink Workshop?

08:57.790 --> 08:59.390
That's quite a bold request.

09:00.670 --> 09:03.000
Isn't it because of the stolen ink recipe

09:03.000 --> 09:05.630
that you've harbored
a grudge against the Li family?

09:05.630 --> 09:06.630
So,

09:06.670 --> 09:08.750
you want to open New Li's Ink Workshop

09:09.030 --> 09:11.480
to take on the Li family directly—

09:11.550 --> 09:12.240
am I right?

09:14.550 --> 09:15.270
Lord Yan,

09:15.600 --> 09:17.130
it's true that I want to vent

09:17.840 --> 09:19.720
the indignation in my heart

09:19.720 --> 09:21.440
by starting my own ink workshop.

09:21.440 --> 09:24.720
But I am no narrow-minded person.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.510
In fact, since I started recreating
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

09:27.510 --> 09:29.270
I've harbored a deeper aspiration—

09:29.270 --> 09:30.790
I wish to contribute
what little strength I have

09:30.790 --> 09:33.440
to the advancement
of our Huizhou ink industry!

09:33.440 --> 09:36.900
So I sincerely ask Your Lordship
to grant me this opportunity.

09:37.840 --> 09:39.300
Grant you an opportunity?

09:40.510 --> 09:41.360
But

09:41.840 --> 09:43.790
as the Ink Affairs Official,

09:44.440 --> 09:47.440
I supervise the selection of Tribute Ink—

09:47.940 --> 09:49.740
I serve the imperial court.

09:50.280 --> 09:53.070
Not to help a young woman like you

09:53.100 --> 09:55.100
realize some personal ambition.

09:55.270 --> 09:57.600
My Lord, that's not quite fair to say.

09:57.840 --> 09:59.550
When I recreated
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

09:59.550 --> 10:01.550
wouldn't that also have helped
ease your burdens?

10:01.550 --> 10:03.480
I could do so before, I can do so now,

10:03.480 --> 10:05.840
and I certainly can do so again
in the future.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.510
What a bold spirit.

10:08.270 --> 10:10.440
But no matter how bold your spirit,

10:10.790 --> 10:11.870
it's of no use

10:12.150 --> 10:12.840
to me.

10:13.910 --> 10:15.960
I only care about results.

10:16.750 --> 10:18.790
Without the help of the Li family

10:18.960 --> 10:21.390
or Eighth Master Li's support,

10:21.720 --> 10:24.030
what do you have to compete against

10:24.080 --> 10:26.790
Li Ink or Chen Ink?

10:26.870 --> 10:30.000
And how will you realize
those lofty ambitions of yours?

10:30.550 --> 10:33.350
You haven't fully
thought this through, have you?

10:34.510 --> 10:35.120
Alright.

10:35.550 --> 10:36.870
Go back and think it through.

10:36.870 --> 10:38.440
When you've figured it out,

10:38.480 --> 10:40.340
come back and speak with me again.

10:40.390 --> 10:43.510
All of you, out! Get out!

10:45.550 --> 10:46.480
You charlatans!

10:46.510 --> 10:47.910
You're all charlatans!

10:47.910 --> 10:49.600
My child! My child!

10:49.630 --> 10:51.000
My child, don't get so worked up!

10:51.000 --> 10:52.320
You mustn't agitate yourself.

10:52.320 --> 10:54.490
It will only worsen your condition.

10:54.630 --> 10:55.440
Father,

10:55.440 --> 10:57.900
none of them are
genuinely trying to cure me!

10:58.340 --> 10:59.670
Don't say that.

10:59.750 --> 11:00.480
Don't worry.

11:00.480 --> 11:02.600
I'll search the entire realm
for the finest physicians

11:02.600 --> 11:04.030
to cure your illness.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.480
Go back and rest. Let's go.

11:05.480 --> 11:06.870
I don't want to rest!

11:06.870 --> 11:08.960
I... I want to go out!

11:14.240 --> 11:16.480
Zhen, why do you seem so down?

11:16.550 --> 11:18.680
Are you still thinking about Miss Yan?

11:20.030 --> 11:21.550
When I came back today,

11:21.600 --> 11:23.270
I asked Physician Huang about her.

11:23.270 --> 11:24.320
He told me

11:24.320 --> 11:25.360
Miss Yan's illness

11:25.360 --> 11:27.030
has remained uncured for over 10 years.

11:27.030 --> 11:28.630
Just imagine the hardship

11:28.720 --> 11:30.850
she must have endured all these years.

11:32.430 --> 11:33.480
Yes.

11:34.840 --> 11:35.600
Zhen,

11:35.720 --> 11:37.150
unfortunately, we are not physicians.

11:37.150 --> 11:38.950
There is little we can do for her.

11:41.030 --> 11:43.270
Hua'er, do you remember
when we were little,

11:43.270 --> 11:44.360
every time I went out to play,

11:44.360 --> 11:46.290
I'd come back covered in injuries?

11:46.550 --> 11:48.080
And then my father, for my sake,

11:48.080 --> 11:49.910
searched through
all of Li Ink's ancient texts for me.

11:49.910 --> 11:50.750
Finally,

11:51.000 --> 11:52.150
he created

11:52.200 --> 11:53.460
a medicinal rouge ink.

11:53.910 --> 11:55.150
I remember now.

11:55.440 --> 11:57.270
You treasured that rouge ink

11:57.270 --> 11:58.240
so much.

11:59.080 --> 11:59.840
Only when I was hurt

11:59.840 --> 12:01.000
would you let me use even the tiniest bit.

12:01.000 --> 12:01.860
Was it that one?

12:02.080 --> 12:02.750
Yes.

12:03.510 --> 12:04.960
My father said at that time

12:04.960 --> 12:06.120
that the medicinal rouge ink

12:06.120 --> 12:07.790
was only his initial experiment.

12:07.790 --> 12:09.320
What he truly wanted to create

12:09.320 --> 12:11.960
was a medicinal ink
capable of treating sores

12:12.120 --> 12:14.580
and stubborn ailments—Nine-Treasure Ink.

12:15.480 --> 12:17.240
If such an ink truly existed,

12:17.390 --> 12:19.750
perhaps we really could cure Miss Yan,

12:19.750 --> 12:20.360
right?

12:20.870 --> 12:22.600
That's exactly what I've been thinking.

12:22.600 --> 12:25.120
Today, Lord Yan asked me at his manor

12:25.200 --> 12:26.200
what my New Li's Ink Workshop

12:26.200 --> 12:27.150
would rely on to establish itself

12:27.150 --> 12:28.670
and what kind of ink I'd sell.

12:28.670 --> 12:29.720
I thought about it.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.960
Although I recreated
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

12:31.960 --> 12:33.910
compared to the precious inks

12:33.910 --> 12:35.550
passed down through Chen Ink and Li Ink,

12:35.550 --> 12:37.350
it still pales in significance.

12:37.510 --> 12:39.390
But if I take another path

12:39.480 --> 12:41.000
and create the Nine-Treasure Ink

12:41.000 --> 12:42.750
my father once talked about,

12:43.000 --> 12:44.750
firstly, I can cure

12:44.750 --> 12:46.390
patients like Miss Yan;

12:46.790 --> 12:48.910
secondly, I can avoid direct confrontation

12:48.910 --> 12:50.630
and build my name upon medicinal ink.

12:50.630 --> 12:52.240
And most importantly,

12:53.040 --> 12:55.360
if I truly succeed in
creating this treasured ink

12:55.360 --> 12:56.720
and curing Miss Yan,

12:57.030 --> 12:59.080
don't you think Lord Yan would finally

12:59.080 --> 13:02.010
step in and allow us to
open the New Li's Ink Workshop?

13:02.030 --> 13:02.670
You're right.

13:02.670 --> 13:04.720
Then, Zhen, let us get started at once!

13:04.720 --> 13:05.790
No need to be so hasty.

13:05.790 --> 13:07.200
This is just my preliminary plan.

13:07.200 --> 13:08.150
We must proceed step by step.

13:08.150 --> 13:10.510
But I think your plan is excellent!

13:10.910 --> 13:12.270
How is Li Ink Workshop doing?

13:11.730 --> 13:13.720
[Yihousheng]

13:14.440 --> 13:15.640
You mean Miss Li Zhen?

13:15.840 --> 13:18.510
She's been having a hard time
these past few days.

13:18.510 --> 13:22.770
I heard Eighth Master Li didn't agree to
her opening the New Li's Ink Workshop

13:22.840 --> 13:24.840
and left She County in a fit of anger.

13:25.150 --> 13:26.440
He went to...

13:27.080 --> 13:28.270
He went to Wuyuan.

13:28.870 --> 13:30.240
I was asking about Li Ink,

13:30.240 --> 13:31.630
not New Li Ink.

13:32.000 --> 13:34.360
Isn't Miss Li Zhen part of the Li family?

13:35.960 --> 13:37.910
Above her stands Li Ink.

13:38.240 --> 13:40.030
The Literary Association, out of deference
to the Li family's standing,

13:40.030 --> 13:41.630
refuses to recognize New Li's Ink Workshop

13:41.630 --> 13:43.360
and has withheld its approval.

13:43.790 --> 13:45.120
I think she must be

13:45.150 --> 13:47.550
at her wit's end
over this matter right now.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.270
Well then,

13:54.840 --> 13:55.910
take out 100 taels

13:55.910 --> 13:58.240
and accompany me to New Li's Ink Workshop.

13:58.320 --> 13:59.000
Master,

13:59.840 --> 14:02.550
a-are you really going to
invest in New Li's Ink Workshop?

14:02.550 --> 14:03.880
What's wrong with that?

14:04.510 --> 14:06.550
One hundred taels is nothing to me.

14:06.910 --> 14:08.240
There's no harm in spreading your bets

14:08.240 --> 14:10.100
across more promising ventures.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.150
Let's go.

14:20.200 --> 14:22.030
Master Qi, I cannot accept

14:22.030 --> 14:22.870
your money.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.850
You think it's too little?

14:25.960 --> 14:27.360
It's not about the amount

14:27.750 --> 14:29.000
but the timing.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.790
Timing?

14:32.550 --> 14:34.120
You're opening your own ink workshop now,

14:34.120 --> 14:35.960
which is exactly when you need money.

14:35.960 --> 14:37.560
Besides, with me behind you,

14:37.600 --> 14:40.080
maybe the Literary Association would be
less inclined to give you a hard time.

14:40.080 --> 14:42.080
So why do you say the timing is wrong?

14:42.150 --> 14:43.480
Precisely because I need money,

14:43.480 --> 14:45.080
I must be even more cautious.

14:45.440 --> 14:46.600
To be honest with you,

14:46.600 --> 14:47.550
I wanted to open my own ink workshop

14:47.550 --> 14:50.200
just so I would no longer
be constrained by others.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.080
So,

14:51.200 --> 14:53.510
you suddenly offer me so much money today

14:53.870 --> 14:56.240
without specifying
the profit-sharing terms

14:56.240 --> 14:58.510
or your plans for the workshop.

14:58.600 --> 14:59.320
Honestly,

14:59.320 --> 15:00.240
it makes me

15:00.270 --> 15:01.440
deeply uneasy.

15:04.120 --> 15:04.910
Miss Li Zhen,

15:05.960 --> 15:07.630
you're in need of money now,

15:08.150 --> 15:10.080
and I'm simply offering timely help.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.390
How did you make me sound like

15:11.390 --> 15:13.360
a predator taking advantage of

15:13.360 --> 15:14.510
your misfortune?

15:15.790 --> 15:16.720
In any case,

15:17.440 --> 15:19.640
I absolutely cannot accept this money.

15:22.550 --> 15:23.670
So, Miss Li Zhen,

15:24.200 --> 15:26.510
are you really rejecting me outright?

15:28.320 --> 15:29.630
I'm turning you down today,

15:29.630 --> 15:31.690
but who can say what the future holds?

15:32.470 --> 15:33.270
Master Qi,

15:33.440 --> 15:35.600
I have confidence in my New Li Ink.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.630
Not only do I want to use my own strength

15:37.630 --> 15:39.600
to start the ink workshop,

15:40.240 --> 15:42.630
but in the future,
I'll openly and honestly

15:42.630 --> 15:43.790
compete with Li Ink.

15:44.030 --> 15:45.360
Perhaps one day,

15:45.510 --> 15:46.720
I'll surpass Li Ink!

15:47.870 --> 15:48.960
When that time comes,

15:48.960 --> 15:51.320
I'll invite you to my ink workshop again.

15:51.390 --> 15:52.840
We can sit down together

15:52.840 --> 15:54.910
and discuss things properly.
How about that?

15:54.910 --> 15:56.390
And what if, by that day,

15:57.270 --> 15:58.510
I've lost interest?

16:00.270 --> 16:02.670
Since I've decided to
open an ink workshop,

16:03.030 --> 16:05.080
I certainly won't disappoint you.

16:07.320 --> 16:07.910
Good.

16:08.390 --> 16:09.990
Xiao Qi, take the money back.

16:18.360 --> 16:19.630
Congratulations, Brother.

16:18.640 --> 16:20.410
[Qingfeng Pavilion]

16:19.670 --> 16:21.390
Your eye for talent has proven itself.

16:21.390 --> 16:23.270
You struck gold
with the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

16:23.270 --> 16:26.730
Barely off the ground
and already yielding handsome returns.

16:26.870 --> 16:27.930
Thank you, Sister.

16:28.240 --> 16:30.600
All of this was within my calculations.

16:34.550 --> 16:36.360
What a waste of good tea.

16:37.360 --> 16:40.440
I'm a fugitive
stripped even of the right to my own name.

16:40.960 --> 16:43.160
How can I be particular about anything?

16:43.440 --> 16:44.790
The dividends from Li Ink

16:44.790 --> 16:46.320
are better than expected.

16:46.550 --> 16:48.150
What are your plans next?

16:49.150 --> 16:50.270
In my opinion...

16:51.630 --> 16:52.960
we should continue investing

16:52.960 --> 16:54.890
and build long-term cooperation.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.270
Sister,

16:59.000 --> 17:00.130
you should continue

17:00.630 --> 17:02.430
to keep the account books for me.

17:02.440 --> 17:03.440
But I hope you can

17:03.440 --> 17:05.510
set aside 30% of the dividends for me.

17:05.510 --> 17:06.510
I have a use for it.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.790
You've set your sights
on some other business venture?

17:09.790 --> 17:11.960
I want to reserve that money

17:12.440 --> 17:13.700
to invest in New Li Ink.

17:15.349 --> 17:16.829
How so?

17:17.880 --> 17:18.400
Originally,

17:18.400 --> 17:20.160
I planned to invest the money

17:20.160 --> 17:22.270
in several major ink workshops.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.480
But the other day,

17:23.790 --> 17:25.589
Li Zhen said something to me.

17:25.880 --> 17:27.680
She said she wanted to use her ink

17:27.829 --> 17:29.200
to compete with Li Ink,

17:29.550 --> 17:30.830
that perhaps one day,

17:30.830 --> 17:33.350
her New Li Ink might defeat Li Ink.

17:34.590 --> 17:36.200
What ambition!

17:36.400 --> 17:37.070
Indeed.

17:37.830 --> 17:39.440
Not only is her ambition great,

17:39.440 --> 17:41.300
but her appetite is just as large.

17:41.510 --> 17:42.880
When I talked to her

17:42.960 --> 17:44.640
about investing the other day,

17:44.640 --> 17:45.970
she actually declined.

17:46.510 --> 17:47.790
Looks like Li Zhen

17:47.880 --> 17:50.480
has her own principles
and way of doing things.

17:52.110 --> 17:53.590
Hearing you describe her like this,

17:53.590 --> 17:55.590
I'd actually like to meet this girl.

17:56.750 --> 17:59.110
The three upper, three middle,
and three lower herbs

17:59.110 --> 18:03.770
stand foremost among all ingredients,
together constituting the Nine Treasures.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.880
These "three lower herbs"

18:05.880 --> 18:08.830
should refer to

18:09.790 --> 18:13.400
ground-level herbs
like kochia fruit and dictamnus bark.

18:14.070 --> 18:14.870
That's right.

18:15.400 --> 18:16.660
Those must be the ones.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.960
And the "three middle herbs" may be

18:18.980 --> 18:21.980
the internal organs
of pigs, sheep, or sea creatures?

18:22.920 --> 18:25.450
But what on earth
are the "three upper herbs"?

18:29.590 --> 18:30.640
What do you want?

18:33.310 --> 18:34.110
Come on.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.960
Escort Li Zhen out.

18:37.480 --> 18:38.880
I'd like to see who dares!

18:40.880 --> 18:43.030
Li Jingdong, what on earth do you want?

18:43.310 --> 18:44.110
Li Zhen,

18:45.000 --> 18:47.680
since you've decided to
establish your own workshop,

18:47.680 --> 18:48.790
the Li family

18:48.790 --> 18:52.050
will not allow you to
take advantage of us in the slightest.

18:52.480 --> 18:53.920
Starting today,

18:54.830 --> 18:56.920
I'm taking back this ink workshop.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.240
Uncle Jingdong,

18:58.680 --> 19:00.750
this was an abandoned ink workshop
of Li family.

19:00.750 --> 19:02.270
Seventh Grandmother
permitted Zhen to use it.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.070
If it is to be taken back,

19:03.070 --> 19:04.680
she should be the one
to come tell Zhen herself.

19:04.680 --> 19:05.640
Yes, Master.

19:05.640 --> 19:07.510
We'd better tell Old Madam.

19:07.510 --> 19:09.970
Do I need you to
teach me how to handle things?

19:13.350 --> 19:15.010
Wang Hua'er, I'm telling you,

19:15.440 --> 19:17.920
I am now the Master of Li Ink.

19:18.510 --> 19:19.920
You'd better remember

19:20.440 --> 19:22.590
who your own kin are.

19:24.750 --> 19:25.680
What?

19:26.030 --> 19:27.110
You're not moving?

19:29.110 --> 19:30.240
Come on, you guys.

19:30.480 --> 19:31.340
Help her along.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.270
Do it!

19:33.240 --> 19:34.300
What are you doing?

19:34.480 --> 19:35.350
What are you doing?

19:35.350 --> 19:36.590
These are my medicinal ingredients!

19:36.590 --> 19:37.310
Let go!

19:37.590 --> 19:38.650
What are you doing?

19:38.680 --> 19:39.680
Don't touch it!

19:39.750 --> 19:40.510
Give it to me.

19:42.920 --> 19:43.830
You can't take it!

19:43.830 --> 19:45.270
These are my medicinal ingredients!

19:45.270 --> 19:45.510
Give them back to me!

19:45.510 --> 19:46.350
You lot!

19:47.590 --> 19:48.650
What are you doing?

19:48.960 --> 19:50.160
Return her

19:51.070 --> 19:52.400
medicinal herbs to her.

20:05.000 --> 20:07.200
You lot, keep your eyes open—

20:08.110 --> 20:10.270
take everything belonging to the Li family

20:10.270 --> 20:11.720
back to our ink workshop.

20:14.790 --> 20:15.680
Fine!

20:18.350 --> 20:19.400
I can move out!

20:20.960 --> 20:22.480
But many tools here

20:22.480 --> 20:24.080
were made by my grandfather,

20:24.110 --> 20:25.200
and some others

20:25.310 --> 20:26.920
were bought piece by piece

20:26.920 --> 20:28.680
by my brother and my mother!

20:29.350 --> 20:30.750
You can force me to leave.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.540
But don't you even think of taking

20:33.640 --> 20:35.920
any of my family's things!

20:36.550 --> 20:37.400
Fine.

20:38.790 --> 20:41.390
The Li family has no use
for your things anyway.

20:43.480 --> 20:44.410
Take them and go.

21:16.590 --> 21:17.270
Hua'er,

21:18.000 --> 21:19.440
don't just stand there.

21:19.920 --> 21:20.640
Go home.

21:54.340 --> 21:58.290
♪ Rain is the burden
clouds can no longer bear ♪

21:58.310 --> 22:02.530
♪ Falling where love and hate intertwine ♪

22:00.160 --> 22:02.240
Girl, do you not know how to drive a cart?

22:02.240 --> 22:04.040
Look, the rain is getting heavier.

22:04.040 --> 22:08.130
♪ I can't rid myself of this hatred ♪

22:04.110 --> 22:05.720
I'm in a hurry to finish work and go home.

22:05.720 --> 22:07.720
Don't block the road with your cart.

22:08.150 --> 22:12.880
♪ It neither fades nor remains hidden ♪

22:08.310 --> 22:09.640
Hurry and move it aside.

22:13.500 --> 22:17.630
♪ Regret is a wound time cannot heal ♪

22:17.650 --> 22:22.180
♪ Once aflame, now chilled ♪

22:23.040 --> 22:27.290
♪ You're the unreachable love I pursue ♪

22:24.480 --> 22:25.240
Go.

22:26.000 --> 22:26.750
Go!

22:27.320 --> 22:33.160
♪ I long for you in my heart,
yet I dare not forget you ♪

22:33.460 --> 22:39.950
♪ Who's to blame, and who remains caught
in endless cycles of love and hate? ♪

22:39.980 --> 22:43.120
♪ I have no regrets about this hatred ♪

22:43.210 --> 22:49.350
♪ As close as kin,
yet as distant as strangers ♪

22:49.460 --> 22:52.530
♪ Who bears the guilt in love? ♪

22:52.750 --> 22:59.130
♪ We cast love aside,
leaving our hearts in pieces ♪

22:59.150 --> 23:02.830
♪ Is it wrong or right? ♪

23:03.360 --> 23:06.080
♪ Standing at opposite ends ♪

23:06.110 --> 23:11.050
♪ We can only face each other in silence ♪

23:11.930 --> 23:18.170
♪ Who's sober, who's drunk, and who
holds back from trying to mend it? ♪

23:18.310 --> 23:21.460
♪ Reason forces us back ♪

23:21.620 --> 23:27.880
♪ When defenses fall,
who is left more broken? ♪

23:27.900 --> 23:31.240
♪ Why keep chasing it? ♪

23:31.260 --> 23:37.380
♪ Half bright, half dim—
an unfinished, imperfect kind of beauty ♪

23:32.070 --> 23:32.720
Mother?

23:35.510 --> 23:36.830
Why are you here?

23:37.500 --> 23:41.570
♪ How should we end this? ♪

23:41.590 --> 23:45.030
♪ I stare through hope and drifting haze,
tears in my eyes ♪

23:44.240 --> 23:45.590
Mother...

23:45.400 --> 23:49.480
♪ Lost and unsure where to go ♪

23:46.550 --> 23:47.080
Let's go.

23:47.880 --> 23:48.880
Let's go home.

23:49.200 --> 23:49.750
Let's go.

23:51.220 --> 23:55.040
♪ I stare through hope and drifting haze,
tears in my eyes ♪

23:55.060 --> 24:01.050
♪ Lost and unsure where to go ♪

23:56.030 --> 23:57.310
Mother...

24:11.790 --> 24:12.920
These past few days,

24:13.310 --> 24:15.240
you've been either making ink
at the workshop

24:15.240 --> 24:16.750
or cooped up in your room,

24:17.550 --> 24:18.960
not even stopping to eat.

24:20.830 --> 24:21.680
At home,

24:21.680 --> 24:23.280
it's often just me by myself.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.070
I cooked some food,

24:25.200 --> 24:26.600
but I can never finish it.

24:28.070 --> 24:28.750
Mother,

24:29.590 --> 24:30.510
it's my fault.

24:31.310 --> 24:32.350
Silly girl,

24:32.790 --> 24:34.450
why are you apologizing to me?

24:34.680 --> 24:36.440
I've watched you grow up.

24:36.920 --> 24:38.640
Even if you say nothing,

24:39.270 --> 24:40.790
I still know what's

24:40.830 --> 24:41.790
in your heart.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.680
You're thinking

24:47.110 --> 24:48.790
of creating the ink as soon as possible

24:48.790 --> 24:50.750
so you can prove yourself
to your grandfather,

24:50.750 --> 24:51.510
right?

24:59.640 --> 25:00.790
But everything

25:00.790 --> 25:02.520
must follow its proper course.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.070
If you keep pushing yourself like this,

25:04.070 --> 25:05.930
your body won't be able to take it.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.790
Conserve your strength, eat properly,

25:08.790 --> 25:11.000
and work on the ink step by step.

25:12.560 --> 25:14.910
You must listen to what I say.

25:15.750 --> 25:16.550
Do you hear me?

25:20.240 --> 25:20.830
Come on.

25:21.720 --> 25:22.720
Tell me,

25:24.880 --> 25:27.310
what kind of ink does Owner Li of

25:27.640 --> 25:30.170
our New Li's Ink Workshop
really want to make?

25:35.310 --> 25:35.880
Mother,

25:36.400 --> 25:37.510
do you remember

25:37.960 --> 25:39.880
that rouge ink Father made for me?

25:41.480 --> 25:42.640
What I want to create

25:43.110 --> 25:45.110
is a kind of medicinal ink like that,

25:45.440 --> 25:46.970
called Nine-Treasure Ink.

25:47.510 --> 25:49.440
Father also researched it before.

25:50.200 --> 25:51.790
But this ink

25:51.790 --> 25:53.640
has been lost for nearly 100 years.

25:53.640 --> 25:55.040
There are only some vague

25:55.070 --> 25:57.870
and unclear records of it
in the "Ink Chronicles."

25:58.270 --> 26:01.200
References to "three upper, three middle,
and three lower herbs,"

26:01.200 --> 26:02.310
along with a few ingredients

26:02.310 --> 26:03.790
I still can't figure out.

26:04.400 --> 26:05.070
Mother,

26:05.510 --> 26:07.510
the ancients are really something.

26:07.640 --> 26:09.160
Since they decided to write a book

26:09.160 --> 26:11.310
to pass down
the ink-making methods and recipes,

26:11.310 --> 26:14.110
why couldn't they just
write plainly and clearly?

26:14.400 --> 26:15.680
Just think of how many fine inks

26:15.680 --> 26:18.010
have been lost to obscurity because of it.

26:19.270 --> 26:20.160
You know,

26:20.270 --> 26:24.400
this "three upper, three middle,
and three lower herbs"—

26:25.480 --> 26:26.960
all that cryptic talk—

26:27.030 --> 26:28.720
your father actually muttered about it

26:28.720 --> 26:30.720
to me for a good while back in the day.

26:31.720 --> 26:32.510
Really?

26:32.510 --> 26:33.200
Really.

26:34.720 --> 26:35.310
Mother,

26:35.960 --> 26:37.350
did Father tell you at that time

26:37.350 --> 26:39.350
what these "three upper herbs" are?

26:40.720 --> 26:42.880
Now you think of asking me?

26:44.270 --> 26:45.310
Oh, you.

26:45.350 --> 26:46.400
If you'd told me earlier,

26:46.400 --> 26:48.030
I would've given it to you long ago.

26:48.030 --> 26:48.640
Wait here.

26:49.750 --> 26:50.590
Where is it?

26:53.270 --> 26:53.750
Here.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.090
Thank you, Mother.

26:57.070 --> 26:58.590
Your father had the habit of

26:58.590 --> 27:00.510
jotting things down
the moment they occurred to him.

27:00.510 --> 27:02.680
So back then, whenever inspiration struck,

27:02.680 --> 27:03.720
he would record his thoughts

27:03.720 --> 27:05.720
in this little account book of mine.

27:06.310 --> 27:07.750
After your father passed away,

27:07.750 --> 27:10.880
I couldn't bring myself
to throw this account book away.

27:11.350 --> 27:13.000
But much of what's in here

27:13.000 --> 27:14.920
is fragmented,

27:15.510 --> 27:17.030
with no clear beginning or end.

27:17.030 --> 27:18.880
It might not have
what you are looking for.

27:18.880 --> 27:20.280
Still, take a look first.

27:38.400 --> 27:39.200
Mother.

27:40.480 --> 27:41.510
This part is

27:41.790 --> 27:44.880
Father's record of experimenting
with Nine-Treasure Ink.

27:44.880 --> 27:45.720
Really?

27:47.510 --> 27:48.960
Turns out Father

27:49.350 --> 27:51.030
also used the fermentation method

27:51.030 --> 27:53.760
to preserve
the medicinal properties back then.

27:54.200 --> 27:54.880
Mother,

27:54.880 --> 27:56.790
I thought of that method too!

27:56.880 --> 27:57.940
That's wonderful!

27:59.110 --> 28:00.110
"Three uppers—

28:00.440 --> 28:02.480
snow lotus, dindygule peperomia...

28:02.480 --> 28:05.110
That's right.
These are the "three upper herbs".

28:05.110 --> 28:06.550
You silly child, why are you crying?

28:06.550 --> 28:08.030
You should be happy instead.

28:08.030 --> 28:12.090
The "three upper herbs" refer to
medicinal herbs growing in high places!

28:12.550 --> 28:14.480
Snow lotus, dindygule peperomia,

28:14.640 --> 28:17.640
and the third herb is... Matchmaker Herb?

28:19.480 --> 28:21.070
What is Matchmaker Herb?

28:21.680 --> 28:24.350
How... how have I never heard of...

28:24.640 --> 28:25.840
heard of such an herb?

28:27.310 --> 28:28.550
Never mind the name—

28:28.680 --> 28:29.920
if it grows in high places,

28:29.920 --> 28:32.200
it must simply be something
found up in the mountains.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.480
I still remember

28:33.480 --> 28:35.000
the mountain forests your father used to

28:35.000 --> 28:36.460
wander through back then.

28:37.310 --> 28:38.070
Alright, alright.

28:38.070 --> 28:38.960
Stop crying.

28:39.310 --> 28:41.070
Zhen, pack your things.

28:41.070 --> 28:42.000
First thing tomorrow morning,

28:42.000 --> 28:43.860
I'll take you into the mountains.

28:47.100 --> 28:51.550
[Wuxi Mountain, Yi County,
Huizhou Prefecture]

29:08.590 --> 29:09.160
Come on.

29:11.000 --> 29:11.960
Well, Zhen?

29:12.030 --> 29:13.760
I don't think this is it either.

29:15.200 --> 29:16.030
Mother,

29:16.160 --> 29:18.400
most of the herbs on the note match up.

29:18.640 --> 29:20.160
Only the Matchmaker Herb

29:20.270 --> 29:21.680
is nowhere to be found.

29:22.590 --> 29:23.790
I've truly never

29:24.030 --> 29:25.830
heard of the herb before either.

29:26.270 --> 29:27.720
Your father really was something.

29:27.720 --> 29:29.980
Couldn't he have written things
a little more clearly?

29:29.980 --> 29:30.920
Now he's got the two of us

29:30.920 --> 29:32.070
wandering around like headless chickens,

29:32.070 --> 29:33.330
without a single clue.

29:34.920 --> 29:36.160
It's alright, Mother.

29:36.160 --> 29:37.070
Worst comes to worst,

29:37.070 --> 29:38.400
we gather everything up here
that looks like a herb

29:38.400 --> 29:39.400
and take it all back

29:39.400 --> 29:40.510
to compare one by one.

29:40.510 --> 29:42.310
There's always a way around difficulties.

29:42.310 --> 29:43.310
-Let's go!
-You girl,

29:43.310 --> 29:44.780
your stubbornness is acting up again.

29:44.780 --> 29:45.130
Let's go.

29:45.130 --> 29:46.790
I'll keep searching with you.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.200
Mother,

30:16.480 --> 30:17.480
did you hear that?

30:17.510 --> 30:19.110
I can play a leaf whistle now!

30:21.510 --> 30:22.680
Wait for me!

30:26.160 --> 30:26.920
Mother!

30:28.750 --> 30:30.590
I told you to be careful.

30:31.000 --> 30:31.790
Now look,

30:31.880 --> 30:33.310
you've still injured your foot.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.160
Does it hurt?

30:34.830 --> 30:37.160
Come on, let me put some herbs
on it for you.

30:37.920 --> 30:38.880
I'm telling you,

30:38.920 --> 30:40.030
this herb

30:40.270 --> 30:42.310
works wonders on wounds

30:43.070 --> 30:44.670
and helps prevent scarring.

30:45.400 --> 30:47.440
I remember back then when your father once

30:47.440 --> 30:49.240
blundered into a hunter's trap.

30:49.350 --> 30:51.410
I used exactly this herb to treat him.

30:52.680 --> 30:53.830
Which hunter's trap

30:53.830 --> 30:56.790
did Father fall into back then?

30:58.030 --> 30:59.630
You already know the answer.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.030
I really don't know.

31:02.350 --> 31:04.720
I only remember that
when I was little, Father told me

31:04.720 --> 31:06.160
he was really good at hunting.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.350
He said he had eyes as sharp as a hawk

31:08.920 --> 31:10.400
and ears as keen as a stalking beast.

31:10.400 --> 31:11.960
and that any prey he set his sights on

31:11.960 --> 31:13.620
could never escape his grasp.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.000
Him?

31:16.880 --> 31:17.790
Your father

31:17.790 --> 31:20.590
only knew how to brag
in front of you and your brother.

31:20.590 --> 31:21.640
Let me tell you,

31:21.880 --> 31:22.590
I never called him out on it

31:22.590 --> 31:24.720
because I wanted to save him some face.

31:29.160 --> 31:30.240
Come to think of it,

31:31.380 --> 31:33.340
your father and I first met...

31:36.310 --> 31:38.040
right here in these mountains.

31:39.510 --> 31:40.480
You met

31:41.110 --> 31:42.640
Father here?

31:43.920 --> 31:44.720
Back then,

31:44.720 --> 31:46.680
I had set some hunting traps.

31:47.030 --> 31:49.430
A day later, I excitedly
went to check them.

31:49.880 --> 31:50.830
And guess

31:51.030 --> 31:52.000
what I found?

31:52.720 --> 31:55.160
Your father, pitiful as could be,

31:55.160 --> 31:56.690
trapped inside one of them!

31:58.000 --> 32:00.240
Then I pulled him out,

32:00.550 --> 32:01.550
brought him home,

32:01.600 --> 32:02.890
fed him a proper meal,

32:02.920 --> 32:04.920
and sent him back down the mountain.

32:05.000 --> 32:06.640
But three days later,

32:06.920 --> 32:10.310
he came back into the mountains again,
supposedly to search for pine.

32:10.310 --> 32:12.070
You know, your father seemed quite clever

32:12.070 --> 32:13.330
when he was making ink.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.880
But the moment he entered the mountains,

32:14.880 --> 32:16.230
he turned hopelessly foolish.

32:16.230 --> 32:19.270
Three times out of five, he'd end up
falling into one of my traps,

32:19.270 --> 32:22.330
then just sit there
waiting for me to pull him out again.

32:22.780 --> 32:25.350
Then you walked right into
his trap as well.

32:25.470 --> 32:27.650
And then you followed him all the way
back to the Li family

32:27.650 --> 32:29.030
and gave birth to my brother and me,

32:29.030 --> 32:29.640
right?

32:30.920 --> 32:32.590
If only it were that easy.

32:33.750 --> 32:34.750
Back then,

32:34.790 --> 32:36.440
the clan elders opposed

32:36.440 --> 32:39.640
your father marrying a descendant
of the Shanyue people.

32:40.500 --> 32:41.460
Then who was it

32:41.480 --> 32:43.790
that gave my brother and me
a chance at life back then?

32:43.790 --> 32:45.320
Who else could it have been?

32:46.960 --> 32:48.200
In this family,

32:49.030 --> 32:50.690
who holds the most authority?

32:51.550 --> 32:52.810
Seventh Grandmother?

32:55.440 --> 32:58.590
Back then, it was your Seventh Grandmother
who argued to the clan elders

32:58.590 --> 33:02.480
that southern migrant clans who married
descendants of the Shanyue people

33:02.480 --> 33:05.830
often found it easier
to establish themselves firmly in Huizhou

33:05.830 --> 33:07.490
and prosper for generations.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.070
And that is how she

33:10.200 --> 33:11.860
persuaded those clan elders.

33:13.030 --> 33:16.430
And so I married into the Li family,
all the way from Yi County.

33:16.640 --> 33:18.880
And that's
how you and your brother came to be!

33:18.880 --> 33:19.720
So,

33:20.310 --> 33:22.910
when your ink workshop
succeeds in the future,

33:22.960 --> 33:25.890
don't forget
your Seventh Grandmother's kindness.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.550
I know, I know.

33:28.350 --> 33:30.110
Seventh Grandmother

33:30.480 --> 33:31.590
had it hard.

33:31.790 --> 33:33.400
My grandfather also

33:33.400 --> 33:34.350
had it hard.

33:34.790 --> 33:35.830
But I think

33:37.000 --> 33:39.330
the one who had it hardest
was you, Mother.

33:40.750 --> 33:42.750
Ever since we were expelled from the clan,

33:42.750 --> 33:44.640
you haven't had a single easy day.

33:45.830 --> 33:46.510
Mother,

33:47.030 --> 33:48.480
once I have the New Li's Ink Workshop
up and running,

33:48.480 --> 33:50.400
I will make sure you live comfortably.

33:50.400 --> 33:52.400
No more days of hardship like these!

33:53.510 --> 33:55.240
At least you have a conscience!

33:57.240 --> 33:57.960
Zhen,

33:58.110 --> 33:59.710
let the past stay in the past.

34:00.110 --> 34:01.200
Just focus on

34:01.310 --> 34:03.830
running New Li's Ink Workshop well

34:04.510 --> 34:06.170
and doing what you truly love.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.030
Mother, look!

34:13.030 --> 34:14.630
This herb really works wonders.

34:14.630 --> 34:16.280
See? It doesn't hurt at all anymore.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.670
S-Stop jumping.

34:17.800 --> 34:19.030
Sit down. Sit!

34:19.230 --> 34:20.190
It doesn't hurt anymore, right?

34:20.190 --> 34:20.760
It doesn't hurt.

34:20.760 --> 34:21.510
Let me tell you,

34:21.510 --> 34:24.000
this grass is called
Scarlet Phoenix Grass.

34:24.400 --> 34:25.480
Back then, when I used it

34:25.480 --> 34:27.000
to treat your father's wounds,

34:27.000 --> 34:28.920
it was he who looked up
the name of this herb

34:28.920 --> 34:29.920
and told me.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.670
Scarlet Phoenix Grass...

34:36.840 --> 34:38.110
What a lovely name.

34:40.230 --> 34:41.400
Scarlet Phoenix...

34:42.480 --> 34:43.630
Grass...

34:45.590 --> 34:46.920
Scarlet Phoenix...

35:04.880 --> 35:06.360
Scarlet Phoenix Grass...

35:11.730 --> 35:13.690
[Wuyuan]

35:11.840 --> 35:13.840
This is a fish roe pattern inkstone.

35:19.440 --> 35:21.900
This is a water-ripple gold-star inkstone.

35:29.480 --> 35:30.410
This one is good.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.000
And this is a rib pattern inkstone.

35:32.000 --> 35:34.130
This inkstone grinds ink most easily.

35:35.070 --> 35:36.110
Then what does

35:37.110 --> 35:39.030
"melon-smooth surface
with a silken grain" mean?

35:39.030 --> 35:40.400
Su Shi once said:

35:40.800 --> 35:43.590
"Not so rough as to hinder the brush,
not so smooth as to repel the ink;

35:43.590 --> 35:45.190
melon-smooth in surface
with a silk-fine grain,

35:45.190 --> 35:46.840
with the resonance
of metal and the virtue of jade."

35:46.840 --> 35:49.670
This phrase describes
the surface of the inkstone

35:49.760 --> 35:51.760
as fine and smooth as a melon's skin.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.000
Look at you—

35:55.440 --> 35:56.550
bad at making ink,

35:56.960 --> 35:59.360
yet surprisingly skilled with inkstones.

35:59.670 --> 36:01.870
So it was the right decision to bring you

36:01.880 --> 36:03.010
to Wuyuan after all.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.200
Grandfather,

36:05.170 --> 36:08.010
so you didn't come here
because you were angry

36:08.280 --> 36:10.200
that Zhen wanted to
open the New Li's Ink Workshop?

36:10.200 --> 36:12.000
Take a look, how about this spot?

36:12.110 --> 36:12.800
Where?

36:12.880 --> 36:13.400
Here?

36:13.820 --> 36:14.960
Come and have dinner!

36:14.960 --> 36:15.690
This will do.

36:15.960 --> 36:16.630
Coming!

36:16.920 --> 36:18.650
Time for dinner, Grandfather.

36:22.920 --> 36:23.760
I especially made

36:23.760 --> 36:25.670
Grandfather's favorite
bamboo shoots and ribs today.

36:25.670 --> 36:27.000
Eat more, Grandfather.

36:33.490 --> 36:34.130
Qiu'e.

36:35.030 --> 36:37.490
I just received
another letter from Mother.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.760
Really?

36:40.670 --> 36:42.800
I miss Mother and Zhen so much.

36:43.880 --> 36:45.540
Zhengliang, what does the letter say?

36:45.540 --> 36:46.740
Read it to us quickly.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.030
Okay.

36:56.030 --> 36:58.110
"Zhengliang, Qiu'e,

36:58.840 --> 37:00.360
all is well at home.

37:00.510 --> 37:01.880
Don't worry about us.

37:03.280 --> 37:06.510
Zhen has already gotten
New Li's Ink Workshop properly set up.

37:06.510 --> 37:09.480
Recently, she's been busy
developing the Nine-Treasure Ink.

37:09.480 --> 37:10.510
According to her,

37:10.590 --> 37:14.030
the method for making medicinal ink
differs from that of all other inks.

37:14.030 --> 37:16.800
Fortunately, Zhen's always been
clever and resilient,

37:16.800 --> 37:18.150
and through relentless effort,

37:18.150 --> 37:20.550
she's already found a promising approach.

37:24.230 --> 37:26.430
How is Grandfather's health recently?

37:26.510 --> 37:28.320
Is he still angry with Zhen?

37:28.670 --> 37:30.330
You should try to persuade him

37:30.760 --> 37:33.420
not to dwell on
the harsh words she said in anger.

37:33.710 --> 37:34.800
In Zhen's heart,

37:34.800 --> 37:36.190
the person she cares about the most

37:36.190 --> 37:37.230
is Grandfather.

37:37.920 --> 37:40.110
We only hope
everything goes smoothly for you all,

37:40.110 --> 37:41.840
and that you return home soon."

37:43.840 --> 37:44.640
Grandfather.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.400
Zhen said

37:53.230 --> 37:55.490
she wants to make the Nine-Treasure Ink?

37:56.230 --> 37:59.090
That was the ink
your father wanted to make the most.

38:01.110 --> 38:01.670
Yes.

38:02.000 --> 38:03.930
That's the ink Mother wrote about.

38:04.630 --> 38:06.830
I'll write back to Mother immediately.

38:07.150 --> 38:07.950
Grandfather,

38:08.230 --> 38:10.280
do you have anything to say to them?

38:16.960 --> 38:20.020
This dish Qiu'e made today
is particularly delicious.

38:21.960 --> 38:23.360
Thank you, Grandfather.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.770
Let's eat first.

38:25.230 --> 38:25.710
Eat.

38:25.730 --> 38:27.260
No rush to write the letter.

39:02.920 --> 39:03.510
Mother!

39:05.510 --> 39:07.110
Mother, come and take a look.

39:10.550 --> 39:11.360
I have to say,

39:11.510 --> 39:13.710
they really do carry a medicinal scent.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.230
And it smells

39:18.510 --> 39:20.230
quite soothing too.

39:21.320 --> 39:23.760
Zhen, does that mean the ink is finished?

39:24.280 --> 39:26.880
There's still one final step
before the medicinal ink is finished.

39:26.880 --> 39:28.070
We need to test
its medicinal effects first,

39:28.070 --> 39:29.930
then make the final adjustments.

39:30.000 --> 39:31.790
And how are you supposed to test that?

39:31.790 --> 39:33.590
[Sanjiu Hall]

39:52.320 --> 39:54.960
As for medicinal ink,

39:55.440 --> 39:57.320
when I was back in the capital,

39:57.440 --> 39:58.800
I did see some of it.

39:59.710 --> 40:01.630
An ink like yours,

40:01.920 --> 40:05.710
capable of balancing medicinal properties
and ink quality so well—

40:05.710 --> 40:08.190
that is truly eye-opening.

40:08.360 --> 40:09.760
You flatter me, Lord Yan.

40:10.670 --> 40:11.760
However,

40:12.710 --> 40:14.710
medicinal ink has never been

40:15.070 --> 40:17.960
considered a mainstream branch
of the ink industry.

40:17.960 --> 40:20.230
So if you intend to rely on this ink alone

40:20.360 --> 40:24.070
to persuade me to secure approval papers
from the Literary Association,

40:24.070 --> 40:26.710
you're still some way short of the mark.

40:27.960 --> 40:30.220
With respect, Lord Yan, I must disagree.

40:30.360 --> 40:31.920
This is the Nine-Treasure Ink.

40:31.920 --> 40:33.070
Ancient texts record

40:33.070 --> 40:35.870
that it once cured
countless stubborn illnesses.

40:36.920 --> 40:37.880
But Lord Yan,

40:37.880 --> 40:40.510
I've come today with a particular request

40:41.110 --> 40:42.840
that concerns you personally.

40:44.190 --> 40:45.670
I wish to use this ink...

40:47.070 --> 40:49.800
to cure the sores on your daughter's face.

40:59.000 --> 41:00.440
Well, well, Li Zhen.

41:01.840 --> 41:03.670
So all your talk has been leading to this—

41:03.670 --> 41:06.440
your calculations have come to
involve my daughter!

41:06.440 --> 41:07.030
No, no.

41:07.030 --> 41:07.920
Not what?

41:08.360 --> 41:11.630
You clearly want to use my daughter
as a walking advertisement

41:11.630 --> 41:13.670
to make a name for your New Li Ink!

41:14.070 --> 41:15.070
Stop pretending.

41:15.280 --> 41:16.710
Take your ink and leave.

41:16.710 --> 41:17.670
Lord Yan,

41:18.710 --> 41:20.510
I know that Miss Yan has suffered

41:20.920 --> 41:23.180
for many years from the sores on her face.

41:23.440 --> 41:25.590
The reason
ordinary physicians' external ointments

41:25.590 --> 41:26.710
and oral medicines

41:26.760 --> 41:28.230
have failed to cure her is

41:28.230 --> 41:30.280
that they lack
a proper medicinal catalyst.

41:30.280 --> 41:32.320
But my Nine-Treasure Ink

41:32.400 --> 41:33.710
uses ink itself as the medicinal catalyst,

41:33.710 --> 41:34.800
targeting the afflicted area directly

41:34.800 --> 41:38.860
while cooling the blood, nourishing
the skin, and preventing scarring.

41:42.280 --> 41:43.230
But

41:43.960 --> 41:45.360
when all is said and done,

41:45.630 --> 41:46.960
the Nine-Treasure Ink

41:47.670 --> 41:49.550
is still little more than a legend.

41:49.550 --> 41:51.480
After all, no one has really seen

41:51.480 --> 41:52.800
how effective it is.

41:53.510 --> 41:54.510
So tell me,

41:55.590 --> 41:58.190
what makes you so sure
you can cure my daughter?

41:59.840 --> 42:02.800
If you ask me how sure I am,

42:02.920 --> 42:04.780
I dare not make any rash promises.

42:04.840 --> 42:07.070
But I've revised and refined

42:07.070 --> 42:09.320
the formula countless times

42:09.400 --> 42:11.000
and have already sent samples
to various medical halls

42:11.000 --> 42:12.000
for testing.

42:13.230 --> 42:14.230
So far,

42:14.230 --> 42:15.550
dozens of people

42:15.590 --> 42:17.070
suffering from persistent, incurable sores

42:17.070 --> 42:19.510
have been completely cured using my ink.

42:19.960 --> 42:22.020
Look, I've recorded every case here.

42:33.150 --> 42:33.840
No.

42:35.070 --> 42:37.280
I can't let my daughter take such a risk.

42:38.670 --> 42:40.190
I won't see you out.

42:40.590 --> 42:41.590
See the guest out!

42:43.590 --> 42:44.590
Please, this way.

42:46.690 --> 42:48.150
Your love for your daughter runs deep.

42:48.150 --> 42:49.150
I understand.

42:49.480 --> 42:51.880
Then I shall not
impose any further for now.

42:54.000 --> 42:56.070
Everything written in
that booklet is true.

42:56.070 --> 42:58.440
You can take a look when you are free.

42:59.440 --> 43:00.920
You can look up the names inside

43:00.920 --> 43:02.380
and verify them yourself.

43:03.230 --> 43:04.510
Goodbye, Lord Yan.
